        Parameters
        ----------
        design : Design
        y : list of float
        lams : list of float
            Penalty strengths, largest first (from ``lambda_path``).
        gammas : list of float
            Relaxations in ``[0, 1]``; 1 is the penalized fit.
        splits : list of (list of int, list of int)
            ``(train, test)`` rows, as ``k_fold`` returns.
        
