        -------
        EventSet
        
        Raises
        ------
        ValueError
            If the index is empty or names a year past the last.
        
        Examples
        --------
        >>> from prospicio.aggregate import EventSet
        >>> e = EventSet.from_years([[], [50.0], [5.0, 60.0]])
        >>> [e.permute([2, 0, 1]).events(i) for i in range(3)]
        [[5.0, 60.0], [], [50.0]]
