        accident date of the prospective period, a decimal year), for factors
        ``(1 + rate) ** (to - accident)``, or a factor per loss.
        
        Parameters
        ----------
        rate : float, optional
        to : float, optional
        factors : list of float, optional
        development : DevelopmentPattern or list of float, optional
