        increasing and concave.
    
    Examples
    --------
    >>> from prospicio.pricing import TabulatedCurve
    >>> t = TabulatedCurve([0.0, 0.1, 0.5, 1.0], [0.0, 0.4, 0.8, 1.0])
    >>> round(t.curve([0.3])[0], 12), t.mean_rate()
    (0.6, 0.25)
    """
